    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χνοάζω</span></b> , prop. of youths, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>get the first down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i>; also of girls, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλητρίδες ἄρτι χνοάζουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Metag.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			 (hex.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλοάζω</span> Iv.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χνοάζων ἄρτι λευκανθὲς κάρα</span>
			just <i>sprinkling</i> his hair with white, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				742
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
